  "notes": [
    "Research overlay only; persistent Shipyard SQLite is never replaced by this package.",
    "Phase 12 is a read-only evidence-viewer extension. It adds visual summaries for the Phase-9 architecture gate, Phase-10 feed decomposition and transient-buffer probes, and Phase-11 inertial-head and hydraulic-power bounds.",
    "The viewer displays total propulsion feed demand rather than assuming equal instantaneous per-tank flow.",
    "The viewer preserves the distinction between research priority and physical selection: pump/header-conditioned feed is shown only as the current next-modeling priority.",
